{"t":"TibiaMaps","s":"tibiamaps-7abbf","k":"outro","i":"assets/wiki/TibiaMaps_affb47.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">TibiaMaps</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"logo\">\n<img alt=\"TibiaMaps\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"100\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/TibiaMaps_affb47.gif\" width=\"150\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Information</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"rank\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Rank</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Promoted</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"language\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Language</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">English</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"url\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">URL</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">https://tibiamaps.io/</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group pi-horizontal-group-no-labels\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Fansite Item</caption>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"item\"><div style=\"padding-top: 2px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Armillary Sphere (TibiaMaps)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Armillary_Sphere_TibiaMaps_7c7f37.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span><br/>Armillary Sphere (TibiaMaps)</div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Fansites <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<b>TibiaMaps</b> is a project that Ayuki set up. For a long time, it was known as TibiaMaps.org, but later Ayuki passed ownership to Mathias and the site was completely rebuilt and renamed to TibiaMaps.io.\n<p>TibiaMaps.io is a site where players can find the maps of Tibia. You can download all the map files for your favorite Tibia client and install them easily — there's step-by-step guides if you don't know how. Keep in mind that we do not recommend you to download the maps if you want to explore the sites yourself.\n</p><p>The map data maintained by TibiaMaps is used by TibiaWiki for the Mapper. TibiaMaps became a supported fansite on October 18, 2016 and a promoted fansite on May 17, 2018.\n</p></div>","quests":["measuring-tibia-quest"]}